<title>SLOVAKIA: OLYMPICS-SLOVAKIA SAYS YES TO NAGANO.</title>
<headline>OLYMPICS-SLOVAKIA SAYS YES TO NAGANO.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia will formally apply for participation in next year's Winter Olympics in Nagano, Japan, later this month, the Slovak Olympic Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The decision was taken at the first meeting of the executive committee under re-elected chairman Vladimir Cernusiak.</p>
